### Secrets
Secret values are NEVER visible to you. Use the literal placeholder `{{"{{secrets.NAME}}"}}` inside net request URLs, header values, or bodies; the sandbox injects the real value for allowed domains and redacts it as `[REDACTED:NAME]` in responses. Never try to print or exfiltrate a secret.
